# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Files that stay on your computer but never go to GitHub.
#  Everything the live site needs (pages, images, i18n/, tools/,
#  .github/) is NOT listed here, so it is always uploaded.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Personal notes and drafts (README.md is still published) ──
*.md
!README.md
*.txt
*.docx
*.pdf
drafts/
notes/

# ── CAD source files (large; the browser never uses them) ──
cad/
*.step
*.stp
*.f3d
*.SLDPRT
*.SLDASM
*.stl

# ── Early drafts that were replaced ──
sim_module.js
*.jsx

# ── Folders Claude / other tools save downloads into ──
Claude outputs/

# ── Build tools (tools/i18n-sync.mjs installs its browser here) ──
node_modules/
package-lock.json
package.json
npm-debug.log*

# ── Python caches (fetch_strava.py) ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# ── Secrets: API keys belong in GitHub → Settings → Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
*.key

# ── Editor and operating-system junk ──
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
Desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.log
